  "editorial": {
    "name": "React Native Paper",
    "descriptionZh": "Callstack 维护的 React Native 组件套件，按 Google Material Design 给齐一整套可定制组件，并用 Material You 做主题系统。",
    "takeawayZh": "照 Components 取 Material 组件换主题。",
    "noteZh": "页头是三段导航 Guides、Components、Showcase 加一个搜索框，右端一枚 5.x 版本下拉。首屏左边大字 “Cross-platform Material Design for React Native”，右边一段说明加 Get started 与 Try on Snack 两个按钮。再往下是虚线描边的卡片网格：第一行 Production-ready components、Material You theming、Accessible by default，第二行 Cross-platform parity、Dark mode support、Migration-friendly docs，六张卡各配一句解释，比如 Material You 那张写的是把 Material 3 的颜色、字体、elevation 和 state layer 交给主题系统。页脚落款 Copyright © 2026 Callstack。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
